Oh, I noticed (via another channel on Facebook) that the binaries are indeed not built for OS X.
I made contact with the CRAN maintainers and they will get it fixed shortly. In the meantime, you can install the latest version of the binaries from here:
https://artifacts.r-hub.io/QCA_3.7-4.tar.gz-3f52609d719f43bca0a42e6d25df0375/
(this link has a lifespan of about two weeks)

I hope this helps,
Adrian

